<title>UK: Euromarket turnover rose in week to Mar 07 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover rose in week to Mar 07 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets rose to $1.129 trillion in the week to March 07 from $1.021 trillion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     53.36		57.43</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     28.68		29.36</p>
<p> Secondary market:		 1075.81	     963.60</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    281.72	     226.85</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	824.65	     757.07</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    304.52	     263.96</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
